<pdd-reason>The browser-source overlay costs 100-300 MB inside OBS on the stream machine (embedded Chromium). Ernest wants the lowest footprint: native OBS text sources driven by a small process, an automatic mode for unattended streams, and a manual mode to flip forward and back through cards.</pdd-reason>
